Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}楼下有位绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's a gentlemen downstairs…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他等一会儿 哈德森夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ask him to wait a moment, Mrs. Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他非常坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's most insistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:02.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《贵族公学》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.82,0:03:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有点劳累过度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have been a little overwrought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是医生 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm a doctor, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你必须放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I must insist that you relax yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在吃东西前先不要讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and say nothing until you have eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果您给我点饼干和牛奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If I might have a biscuit and a glass of milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样的话我一定会好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have no doubt I should soon be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森夫人现在正准备吃的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Hudson is preparing something at this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 请原谅我的衰弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Please, please, please forgive this weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真的必须…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I really must…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听您吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}At your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}文学硕士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Master of arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哲学博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor of Philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修道学校的校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Principal of the Priory School.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈克斯达堡博士 像您这样显贵的漂流者\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is it not everyday, Doctor Huxtable,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我家炉前的地毯上遇难\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that so distinguished a castaway as yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可不是每天都有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is beached upon on the hearthrug.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了猜测是什么风暴把您吹到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In speculating what storm had blown you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我擅自查看了您的个人物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I took the liberty of searching your person,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望您会原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I hope you will forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes, yes of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Please sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.93,0:04:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的表\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前的三十年里没出现一点瑕疵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Unblemished for at least thirty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而今天早上却被刮花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}suddenly this morning scratched.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当您把这些硬币揣进背心口袋里时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When you thrust those coins,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.53,0:04:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在无意之中将其划破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}unthinkingly into your waistcoat pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一生的严习被置于不顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The stern habit of a lifetime trampled under foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件事可能微不足道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A small occurrence perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但值得思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but own small think in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一根颤动的针\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that a vibrating needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能就预示着一场地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}may signal an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.07,0:04:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你脏乱的胡须表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The state of your beard demonstrates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的生活方式被明显打乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a considerable disruption to your routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在三天前？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Three days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.85,0:04:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.93,0:04:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.53,0:04:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我请求你与我一同\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes, I beg you to accompany me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}立即北上前往麦克尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}north to Mackleton immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是极为重要的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A matter of the utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕难从命\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe, I regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生大夫和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor Watson and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前焦头烂额\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}are extremely pressed just at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要处理费尔斯文件案\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm retained in the case of the Ferrers Documents,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生大夫还告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and Doctor Watson tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他正为目前猩红热的流行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that he's run off his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忙得不可开交\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by this recent epidemic of this Scarlet Fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且阿巴加文尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And then of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀案马上就要开审了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}there's Abergavenny murder coming off trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 唯有极其重要的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now, only a very important issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才能引起我们的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}could call us away at the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重要的 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Important, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重要的案件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Important?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问您听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I dare say you've heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔得芮斯公爵吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the Duke of Holdernesse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前内阁大臣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The former cabinet minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅如此 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}More than that, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他名字背后的头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The letters after his name, huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是数不胜数\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}almost half the alphabet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王最伟大的臣民之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One of the greatest subjects of the crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 哈克斯达堡博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}hey Doctor Huxtable?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不但是最伟大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One of the greatest and probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且还是最富有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}one of the wealthiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}容我骄傲地宣布 他也是我的邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He is also, I'm proud to say, in my neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔得芮斯府 他的乡间住宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holdernesse Hall, his countryseat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离修道院公学很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is across from the valley from the Priory School.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵深居简出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Duke is an intensely solitary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他回避公众的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He appalls the prospect of public scrutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在此事上 这也成了他焦虑的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but such is his anxiety in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人已经准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that his grace is prepared to write a check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}花五千英磅来掩人耳目\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for five thousand pounds to see the business off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一千英磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and another thousand pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:06:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使坏人得到应有的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to see justice visited upon the villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情就是如此重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That is how important it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诱人的回报 哈克斯达堡博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A princely offer, Doctor Huxtable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但您并没有陈述案情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You have failed in describing villainy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨特尔勋爵 公爵的独子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lord Saltire, the Duke's son, his only child,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}has been abducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从修道公学里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}From the Priory School?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.97,0:06:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你的管护下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When he was in your care?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.45,0:06:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事就发生在三天前？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And this abduction happened three days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上周六的晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Last Saturday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为何过了这么久才来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why have you waited so long before consulting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His Grace has a deep horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这会把他的家庭不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of his family unhappiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.80,0:06:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公之于众\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}being dragged before the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵要求警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The police have been requested by the Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带着这种警戒行事 他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to proceed with such caution that they…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事件处理得极为不妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This affair has been deplorably handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得不承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I feel it and admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索要多少赎金呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What form of the demand for ransom take?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There has been none.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要赎金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No demand for ransom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}None.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is one of the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最为令人困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}perplexing aspects of the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是男孩并不是唯一失踪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for the boy was not alone in his flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}德育教师赫尔·黑底格\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Herr Heidegger, the German master,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is also missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便说一句 连同他的自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as indeed, by the way, is his bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是他绑架了男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If he has abducted the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何没有接到索要赎金的要求呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}why has no demand for money been received?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑底格是从瑞士来投奔我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Heidegger came to me from Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对他的评价一向很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with the very best references.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一辆自行车丢失吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Was any other bicycle missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.64,0:07:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你确定吗？- 确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- You're certain? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾威灵先生检查过所有的自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Quite Mr. Aveling checked all the bicycles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈克斯达堡博士 你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor Huxtable do you really mean to suggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个德语教师骑着自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that this German master rode off upon his bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.17,0:07:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把男孩夹在腋下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the dead of night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.53,0:07:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在黑夜出逃吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}bearing the boy in his arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你得出的是什么结论？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then what is this theory in your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.45,0:08:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自行车可能是个障眼法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The bicycle may have been a blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可能把车藏在什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He may have hidden it somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}双双步行离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the pair gone off on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然他也可以藏上两辆自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Surely he would have hidden a couple of bicycles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他想造成这种假象的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if he desired to give that impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes I suppose he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然他会 哈克斯达堡博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Of course he would. Doctor Huxtable,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的障眼法理论显然说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}this blind theory of yours will not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这也算是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is an admirable starting point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.31,0:08:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个调查的良好开端\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你能马上叫辆马车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson, would you send for the cab immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在吗 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫车 收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Set, and pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We got just enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以赶上从圣潘拉斯出发的午夜火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to catch the overnight train from St Pancras.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈克斯达堡博士 我将去你那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor Huxtable I shall do a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做一点调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}work at your doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许火车上不算太冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Perhaps the train is not so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但像华生和我这样的两条老猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but the two old hounds like Watson and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能会嗅出点什么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}make get a sniff on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想萨特尔勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I imagine the arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到你的学校就读\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of Lord Saltire at your school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你来说一定是无尚荣耀吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}must have been quite a feather in your cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我最骄傲的时刻 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My proudest moment, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱克威尔发表\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ever since Blackwell's published.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:03.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 《哈克斯达堡对贺拉斯之管见》时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Huxtable's Sidelights on Horace,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在当时可是小有名气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a notable little success in his day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你可能听说过 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- You may have heard of it. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那孩子有多大 - 九岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- How old is the boy? - Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他入学多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And he's been with you how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从冬季学期开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh since the beginning of the winter term.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个特别的孩子 他很快适应了学校生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}An unusual boy, he seemed to be fitting in well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He um…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在家里过得不怎么开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he was not entirely happy at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵的婚姻不算幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Duke's marriage has not been a peaceful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去年双方协议分居\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It ended in separation by mutual consent last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵夫人搬回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Duchess has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她父亲在威尼斯的府邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to her father's palatso in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于公爵的婚姻状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This picture, of the Duke's marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是如何得知的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}how did you come by it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事人尽皆知吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is it common knowledge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟瓦尔德先生私下聊过几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've had some confidential talks with Mr. Wilder,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是公爵的秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the Duke's secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他提供了很多信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's been most helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想已经证实\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And I suppose it has been established.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.37,0:09:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那孩子并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that the boy has not returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去意大利找他母亲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to his mother in Italy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.44,0:09:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 已经证实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes. Yes it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法告诉你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I cannot tell you, Mr. Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对我是多大的心理安慰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what a relief it is to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 来了 - 您的饭 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- Coming! - Your picnic, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森夫人 你怎么猜到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Hudson, how did you guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经验而已 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Experience, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这意味着这两位先生可以在火车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well that means the two doctors can picnic away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}边吃饭边讨论重要问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to their hearts content on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算是我 可能都会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Even I may find my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.51,0:10:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在充满乡土芳香的气氛中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is keener for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.35,0:10:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胃口忽然变好了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the bracing atmosphere of the peat country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我可以公正地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think I will do myself no injustice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修道院公学是英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when I say that the Priory School.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好的预备学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is the most select preparatory school in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱瓦斯托克伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lord Leverstoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱克沃特的伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the Earl of Blackwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.71,0:10:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及卡其卡特·索姆兹爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sir Cathcart Soames,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都把自己的儿子托付给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}they all have entrusted their sons to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从这儿是看不见霍尔德芮斯府的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You can't see Holdernesse Hall from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在礼拜堂塔上的视线是绝佳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but there's a very fine view from the chapel tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些遗址就不用看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Heritage is skipping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从那孩子的房间开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I will begin with the boy's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他父亲写的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}From his father?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是他失踪那天早上送来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It arrived on the morning of his disappearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他收到过从意大利来的信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Had he received one from Italy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.45,0:11:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Where is the letter now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找不着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It cannot be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被绑架时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It must have been on the boy's person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信一定在他身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when he was abducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁睡在隔壁房间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who sleeps in the adjoining room?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么大事 你们干你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's alright. Just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢说你这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I know this sort of chap I dare say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}睡觉遇到打雷也闹不醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He could sleep through a thunderstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不这么认为 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't think he would sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的吗 你为什么这么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Really and why is that do you suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有只老鼠 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's a mouse sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在壁板上 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In the wainscot, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我们俩都吵醒了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And it wakes us both up sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事时而会发生 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sometimes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老鼠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那萨特尔勋爵房间有什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So any noise from Lord Saltire's room…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}门的响声 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well the door creaks sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总会听到门响的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You always hear the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.39,0:12:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他失踪的那天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}On the night of the disappearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有听到什么异常吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}did you hear anything then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.85,0:12:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至连哭声都没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You couldn't even hear the crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哭声？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.85,0:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有时会哭 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He sometimes cries sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时而已 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sometimes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.95,0:12:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在地面上没有发现什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You have found nothing in the grounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现的东西都没很大用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's no knowing what I have found.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}痕迹都被毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The trail is cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Headmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Headmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.35,0:14:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔德芮斯公爵到了 校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Duke of Holdernesse is here headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 艾威灵先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you, Mr. Aveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和瓦尔德先生一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}With Mr. Wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵在等着呢 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Duke is waiting, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么会没用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That will never do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.97,0:14:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瓦尔德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.49,0:14:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我昨天给你打电话了 哈克斯达堡博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I called yesterday, Doctor Huxtable,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但要阻止你去伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to prevent your starting for London.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈克斯达堡博士 公爵大人很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His Grace is surprised, Doctor Huxtable,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在没有咨询他意见的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that you should of invited Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就擅自邀请福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to undertake an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来进行调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}without consulting him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想警察们没有进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well I thought that the police had failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有确切证据表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is by no means certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.65,0:14:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察没有进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that the police have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:14:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错 但说实话 瓦尔德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, but surely, Mr. Wilder…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定很明白 哈克斯达堡博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You're well aware, Doctor Huxtable,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人很焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}how anxious his Grace is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他极其想避免公众丑闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to avoid all public scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他希望在这件事情上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He prefers to take as few people as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知情的人越少越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}into his confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 瓦尔德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sorry, Mr. Wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很容易补救的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The matter is easily remedied.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歇洛克·福尔摩斯先生可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes can return to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐早晨的火车回伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by the morning train.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不尽然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hardly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不尽然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hardly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.49,0:15:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢北部爽朗的空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I enjoy your invigorating northern air.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论如何 我都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall spend, at any rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在您的旷野上度过几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a few days upon your moors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.91,0:15:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁知道我会不会找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who knows I may at least find.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫尔·黑底格的自行车或者别的啥东西呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Herr Heidegger's bicycle, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.68,0:15:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可不是小事 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is not a trivial matter, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴您能这么想 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I am gratified that you think not, your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果要说有什么意义 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If there was meaning in that remark, Mr. Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕我没有看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm afraid it escaped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您唯一的孩子失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your only child has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的希望 您的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your hopes, your future,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您高贵的家族前程\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}your noble family itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.63,0:15:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有断送的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is threatened with disillusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想说什么 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your point, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:15:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想问公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I ask your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么才是本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what is modesty to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.61,0:16:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您儿子的生命对家族更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to your child's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亦或是他的名声对家族更重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Or his reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个问题我暂时无法回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not then it might be replied.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.77,0:16:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有荣誉 还谈什么延续\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what is continuance without honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而我觉得你的话基本是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}However, I believe you are largely in the right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.64,0:16:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If you refer to the constraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给警方活动所设下的约束\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have placed upon the activities of the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许我是有点强人所难\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}then perhaps I have imposed too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有种病态的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have a morbid fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}害怕公共的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of the public gaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们不接受福尔摩斯先生的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It would be foolish not to avail ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那将是愚蠢的 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of Mr. Holmes' services, James,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何况他已经来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}now that he is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.66,0:16:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许你应该跟我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Perhaps you would like to come and stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}住在霍尔德芮斯府\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at Holdernesse Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I thank your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我想为了我的调查能顺利进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I think for the purposes of my investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:17:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是留在这奇案发生的现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it would be wiser for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要更加明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to remain here at the scene of the mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瓦尔德先生或是我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Wilder or myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会给你提供任何\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}will be available to provide you with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能需要的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}any assistance that you might require.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能不能问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Might I ask whether.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.97,0:17:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于你儿子的神秘失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you have formed any explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想起什么起因没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as to the mysterious disappearance of your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, sir. I have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个好孩子 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He is a fine boy, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他到你班上多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And how long has he been in your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从他到这儿开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Since his arrival here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于他的家庭 他谈得多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did he speak much of his family?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以我个人之见 他想念他母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's my belief that he missed his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能这与他父亲所作所为有关 你知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}this is something of his father's doing, do you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.99,0:17:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于公爵和公爵夫人的分居\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The separation between the Duke and the Duchess,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他谈起过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}did he talk about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不见得\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有点神秘 那孩子强调\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's a little mysterious. The boy insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:17:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们两人互相深爱着彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that they loved each other very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:17:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不认为不和的传闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You don't soppose there'll be whistling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是流言吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the wind and all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.69,0:18:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 他是个非常现实的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No he is a very realistic child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 但不是个非常现实的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe, but not a very realistic family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人告诉我 他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was told that they.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾经是地狱火俱乐部的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}were once members of the Hellfire Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你应该不会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You wouldn't know, I suppose,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.89,0:18:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在失踪案的那天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what time Herr Heidegger retired to his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫尔·黑底格是何时回房的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on the night of the disappearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不确切 但很晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not really but quite late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十一点之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}After eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是那晚的值班老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He was duty round master that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他还骑自行车吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And a cyclists I believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, oh yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨特尔勋爵会不会骑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did Lord Saltire ever accompany him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 他还保持不了平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No he is not yet able to retain his balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜你应该不会碰巧知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You wouldn't, I suppose,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑底格的自行车轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}happen to know the make of tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.59,0:18:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么牌子的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on Herr Heidegger's bicycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布瑞门出产的 不错的自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A lovely bicycle by the way made in Bramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轮胎是帕默牌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The tires were Palmer,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是上面有条状花纹的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you know the ones with longitudinal tread.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.73,0:18:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I know the ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.36,0:18:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太有用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doubly helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的荣幸 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Pleasure, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚饭八点开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dinner will be at eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个案子吸引住我了 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This case grows upon me, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有几点显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There are decidedly points of interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.46,0:19:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此案有重大联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in connection with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来看看这幅地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Here look at this map.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以肯定有些地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There are certain geographical features,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与我们的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which may have a good deal to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关系密切\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑色方框是修道院公学\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This dark square is the Priory School.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个 大路在一英里之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This, the main road with no side turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是没有拐弯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for a mile either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}学校的北部\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}To the north of the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地势缓缓升起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the land rises slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.74,0:19:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}南部\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}To the south,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一大块荒原\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a large district of arable land,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.22,0:19:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有高墙和篱笆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with high walls and hedgerows,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骑自行车是不可能通过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}impossible territory for a bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.23,0:19:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在奥卡堡有什么发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh what did you discover at Oakborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.11,0:20:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well the police had reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做了全面的询问\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否看到一个男人跟一个男孩在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on a man and a boy seen together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在今天清晨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They completed their investigation on the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完成了这项调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}early this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么结果？- 一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}- What result? - Useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟勋爵与德语教师的特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}None bore the slightest resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有丝毫相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of the boy or the German master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.43,0:20:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些错误的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This mass of mistaken sightings, Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证实了我的怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it confirms my suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他们没走大路\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't believe they used the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.45,0:20:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通往静谧之处的荒凉小径\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That path of curiosity of quiet places.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定会带来发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}will surely find the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为他们根本就没走大路\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't think they used the road at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.70,0:20:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但自行车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But the bicycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骑车高手不一定非得在大路上才能骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A good cyclist does not need a road, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荒原上小路错综复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The moor is intersected with paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.78,0:20:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得那时是满月\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I remember the moons that were full.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们问题的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now it is to the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定就藏在北方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that our quest must lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做得很好 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You have done well, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.75,0:20:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快到晚饭时间了 很高兴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dinner's soon, you'll be happy to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但还有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I have do just have one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.97,0:20:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要做一些调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on which I need to be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫尔·黑底格的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Herr Heidegger's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:21:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯博士正在探寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doctor Holmes is being delving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍尔德芮斯家庭的起源\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}into the origins of the Holdernesse family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.85,0:21:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像许多远古的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Like many ancient lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自一条肮脏的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it sprang from a very muddy source.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肮脏专家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Muddy Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用说得太详细了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well not to be too delicate about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是盗牛贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}they were cattle thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}农民阶级 有胆有谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A worrier class, ingenious,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他们钱财的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}daring but the basis of their wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却与别人家的牛休戚相关\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}was running off with other people's cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.23,0:21:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯甚至还告诉我 霍尔德芮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes even tells me that Holdenesse has furnished.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给地狱火俱乐部的疯子提供过资助\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}one of the madder members of the Hell Fire Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.72,0:21:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈克斯达堡博士 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What is the matter Doctor Huxtable?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但显然是有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But it's clearly something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.58,0:21:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的期望过高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I expect too much I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是兼职\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is a part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说你的期望吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Tell us your expectations?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不期望奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I do not expect miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我并不是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think I am not a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.69,0:22:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}需要奇迹的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who demands the miraculous…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你还是什么都没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but you have discovered nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We haven't found,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我们离开伦敦后一点证据也没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}not a jot since the moment we left London.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然在事实上并不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Although indeed that is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.05,0:22:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你发现了两件事 但都微不足道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You have discovered two things, both falsums.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.04,0:22:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个是一条无中生有的流言\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One, a squalid piece of gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.27,0:22:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一个就是关于我伟大赞助人家世的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the other an epocriful and insulting fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.74,0:22:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无礼猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}about the origins of my great patron.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我请你们来 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I did not employ you to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是要给霍尔德芮斯的家庭蒙羞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to blacken the name of the Holdernesses', Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.27,0:22:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷静下来 哈克斯达堡博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Calm yourself, Doctor Huxtable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 我们已经发现了一些线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We have in fact, found some way,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.26,0:22:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以向你陈述一些细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I can describe to you in some detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是关于在那个戏剧性的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what took place in this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.12,0:22:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}学校里到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on that fateful night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.72,0:22:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及你那极其忠诚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Also the behavior of your excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.36,0:22:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}德语教师的作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and faithful German master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.21,0:22:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忠诚的黑底格吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Faithful, Heidegger?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫尔·黑底格在十一点过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Herr Heidegger retired to his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到了他的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}soon after eleven o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.02,0:23:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是那晚的值班人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He was the duty master that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.42,0:23:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我的朋友兼同事 华生大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now my friend and colleague, Doctor Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将重现当晚的情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}will impersonate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.16,0:23:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑底格还要工作两个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Heidegger has still two hours work ahead of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.91,0:23:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经度过了劳累的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and it's been a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他脱了外衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He allows himself the comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.67,0:23:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让自己更舒服些\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of removing his jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他走到门边的箱柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He moves across to the chest by the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.09,0:23:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给自己倒了一杯雪莉酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and pours himself a glass of sherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.93,0:23:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼前的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Badly needed fortification.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.77,0:23:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十分需要酒的支撑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of the task that lies ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.87,0:23:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他拿起烛台\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He collects the candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将其放到桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and moves to his desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.01,0:23:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有22本作业要批\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to correct twenty-two exercise books,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.49,0:23:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅包括语法练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which contain not only Grammatik exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.23,0:24:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一篇冗长的作文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but also a lengthy composition.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.93,0:24:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的观点是 哈克斯达堡博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You see my point, Doctor Huxtable,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.26,0:24:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他没再干什么别的事的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it would have been well after midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.03,0:24:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当他吹灭蜡烛时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if he had done nothing else,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.43,0:24:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是午夜过后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when his candle fails him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.77,0:24:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蜡烛放在门边的箱子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The candles are kept in the chest by the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他起身想再拿一支\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He arises from the desk to fetch another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.58,0:24:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但没有光线 他找不到蜡烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but he cannot see to find them,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.29,0:24:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他走到窗旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so he turns to the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.06,0:24:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉开窗帘\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to draw the curtains.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.14,0:24:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想借助月光看得更清楚点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to see better by the moonlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.21,0:24:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在门塔的屋顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Across the rooftops on the gate tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.48,0:24:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}男孩正在等待黑暗的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the boy has been waiting for darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.08,0:24:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样他的逃跑就不会被发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}knowing that his flight must not be observed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.84,0:24:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫尔·黑底格看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Herr Heidegger watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.96,0:24:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那孩子翻过墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as the boy hurries across the ledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.81,0:24:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去赴河边的约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to keep his prearranged meeting by the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.89,0:24:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感到事态严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Sensing the enormity of what was taking place,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.03,0:24:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑底格跑向门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Heidegger runs to the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.02,0:25:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这样碰倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}knocking over what remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.86,0:25:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他喝剩的那杯雪莉酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of his glass sherry as he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.05,0:25:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.34,0:25:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.98,0:25:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来是我低估你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It seems I misjudged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.96,0:25:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他做出去追赶孩子的这一决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The wisdom of his choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.59,0:25:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其理性是值得商榷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to pursue the boy is questionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.30,0:25:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信他的命运由此扭转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I believe his fate may be sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.01,0:25:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请容我发问 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You'll allow me, Mr. Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.41,0:25:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的意思是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.87,0:25:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望不是这样 但如果我的推断没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I hope not but if my reasoning is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.64,0:25:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我真的为他担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}then I do fear for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.87,0:25:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那孩子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And the boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.28,0:25:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈克斯达堡博士 此案的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The key to that, Doctor Huxtable,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.81,0:25:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}remains out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.02,0:25:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在吉尔桥的另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Beyond the Drover's Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.17,0:26:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的牲畜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Poor beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.22,0:26:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报喜鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Carrying crows.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.37,0:26:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们名不符实\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They ruin their name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.13,0:26:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So were assuming the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那孩子被绑上马背带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}was taken away on horseback are we not?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.93,0:26:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.39,0:26:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则黑底格就不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Otherwise Heidegger would not have.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.51,0:26:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骑自行车来追赶他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}needed a bicycle to pursue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.83,0:26:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们只能找到牛的脚印 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But the only tracks we've found are cattle, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.99,0:26:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.99,0:26:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.18,0:26:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}痕迹 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A track, Watson!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.75,0:26:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A track.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.31,0:26:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自行车的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A bicycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.87,0:26:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是某辆自行车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Certainly a bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.96,0:26:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不是我们要找的那辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but not the bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.46,0:26:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很熟悉42种\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm familiar with forty-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.06,0:26:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轮胎留下的不同印迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}different impressions left by tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.04,0:26:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是邓洛普牌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is a Dunlop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.17,0:26:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外胎是加厚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with a patch upon the outer cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.44,0:27:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑底格的车胎是帕默牌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Heidegger's tires were Palmers,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.62,0:27:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是黑底格的车轮留下的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}this is not Heidegger's track.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.31,0:27:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是谁的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who's then?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.52,0:27:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底是谁的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who's indeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.08,0:27:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.28,0:27:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个是帕默牌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}These are Palmer tracks,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.84,0:27:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑底格走过这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Heidegger has been this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.36,0:27:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Absolutely extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.30,0:27:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓洛普的车胎痕迹行驶过150码后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dunlop tracks for a hundred fifty yards,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.02,0:27:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}they vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.87,0:27:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而帕默车胎很清楚地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and Palmer tracks quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.58,0:27:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}指向了这些岩石\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}leading to these rocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.49,0:27:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后也消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}they vanish too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.98,0:27:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到处都没有马的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not a sign of a horse anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.62,0:27:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 对于明显痕迹的发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson, you have a blazing talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.81,0:27:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有惊人的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for observing the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.25,0:27:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该带点午餐来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I should have brought some luncheon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.93,0:27:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底赫尔·黑底格在追什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Anyway what was Herr Heidegger cycling after,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.72,0:28:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}cows?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.71,0:28:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按理说他们不会用牛背\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Presumably they didn't abduct the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.52,0:28:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来绑架那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on the back of a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.86,0:28:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马的痕迹被抹去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}All traces of horses obliterated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.61,0:28:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证据显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In much evidence the two bicycles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.53,0:28:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两辆自行车凭空消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}have vanished into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.93,0:28:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.10,0:28:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.62,0:28:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不可能再犯早前的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is impossible as we have mistaken it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.18,0:28:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 在某个方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}therefore, in some respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.10,0:28:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一定是理解错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}we must have mistaken it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.66,0:28:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荒原边上更远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's a hostelry mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.30,0:28:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有旅店的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on the further edge of the moor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.67,0:28:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.89,0:28:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彻斯特菲尔德路上有个旅店\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}there's a hostelry on the Chesterfield Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.37,0:28:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们沿着这个方向走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes if he we keep on this line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.26,0:28:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就能到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}we should come up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.79,0:28:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得到那儿去碰碰运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well that's where I'm going to try my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.92,0:28:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.62,0:29:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.78,0:29:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.31,0:29:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的朋友 你一定饿扁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Of course my dear fellow you must be starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.82,0:29:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在看看地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now observe that map.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.88,0:29:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会看到有家旅店\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You will see that there's a hostelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.24,0:29:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沿这个方向再走三英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}about three miles in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.66,0:29:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一会儿要见霍尔德芮斯公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We'll need some food if we're going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.23,0:29:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得好好吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}face the Duke of Holdernesse later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.90,0:29:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有发现吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.30,0:29:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.97,0:29:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须告诉公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must tell his Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.68,0:30:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有发现吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.67,0:30:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.24,0:30:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.46,0:30:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.54,0:30:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.17,0:30:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这旅店就像这板上的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Primitive but forceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.82,0:30:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}破旧却可憎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as sporting portraits go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.81,0:31:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢宾·黑斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Reuben Hayes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.90,0:31:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道我的名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.53,0:31:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}门上印着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's printed over the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.11,0:31:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We were looking for some refreshment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.96,0:31:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Were ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.46,0:31:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您能提供的话将不胜感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And would be obliged if you could furnish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.04,0:31:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.26,0:31:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We would.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.59,0:31:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得问问那女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You must ask the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.43,0:31:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Insufferable lout.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.75,0:31:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果今天下午\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If were going all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.60,0:31:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要去霍尔德芮斯府的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to Holdernesse Hall this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.16,0:31:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以雇几匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}let us try to hire those unpreconditioned beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.22,0:31:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.01,0:31:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要骑多远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How far are you taking them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.89,0:31:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从这到府邸一个来回\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Just to the Hall and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.59,0:32:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您应该知道路程吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You know the way, I dare say?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.89,0:32:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在那儿工作了十五年\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I worked there for fifteen years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.31,0:32:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 你们可以骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yeah, you can take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.43,0:32:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑斯先生 你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My word, Mr. Hayes, you have injured yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.53,0:32:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.51,0:32:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是医生 我确定你真的伤着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I am a Doctor sir, and assure you it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.22,0:32:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该包扎一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You should have it attended.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您怎么伤到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How did you come by it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.22,0:32:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的狗咬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One of my dogs did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.13,0:32:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些是抓伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Those scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.77,0:32:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.41,0:32:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}粗看之下 伤痕之间离得很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well at a gentler glance they were that far apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.93,0:32:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么动物能造成这样的抓伤呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What animal would make such a scratch?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.13,0:32:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是公鸡中的战斗鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Probably a descendent of the champion jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.51,0:32:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斗鸡是法律明文禁止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Cockfighting is forbidden by law.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.42,0:32:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且被禁了五十年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and has been for fifty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.79,0:32:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法律禁止的东西可多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Many things are forbidden by law.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.29,0:32:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这样的地方哪有什么法律可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What law is there in such places as these?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.90,0:32:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太棒了 黑斯夫人 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe excellent, Mrs. Hayes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.97,0:33:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你煮了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What have you cooked?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.61,0:33:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}血布丁 甜点和坚果\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Blood pudding, sweets and nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.91,0:33:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么样 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How is it, Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.01,0:33:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太恶心了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is disgusting, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.08,0:33:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.48,0:33:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她被什么东西吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}she's frightened of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.40,0:33:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许不单是被她的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and more than that husband of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.60,0:33:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诡计一环套一环\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Deception upon deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.39,0:33:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这一环环都是为了隐藏什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What was it intended to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.88,0:33:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诡计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Deception?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.10,0:33:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh, Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.40,0:34:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马蹄是跛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}my horse is lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.25,0:34:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.92,0:34:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}旧蹄铁 新掌钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Old shoes, new nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.65,0:34:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.53,0:34:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人现在要见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His Grace will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.70,0:35:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瓦尔德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe, Mr. Wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.62,0:35:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes, Doctor Watson,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.40,0:35:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎来到霍尔德芮斯厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}welcome to Holdernesse Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.59,0:35:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人一会儿就过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His Grace will be joining us shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.71,0:35:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们对您的推理绝技抱以厚望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We are placing high hopes on your skills Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.26,0:35:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您带来什么新闻了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did you bring news?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.07,0:35:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There is just one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.29,0:35:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还没搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in which I need to be satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.75,0:35:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes Mr. Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.42,0:35:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这牵扯到公爵的个人隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It concerns the Duke's private concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.84,0:35:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为公爵大人的私人秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}As his Grace's private secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.49,0:35:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我能帮上点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}perhaps I can be of some assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.13,0:35:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道在事情发生的那一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I believe his Grace wrote to his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.45,0:35:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人曾写信给他的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}upon the day this incident occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.35,0:35:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 那是在前一天写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No I believe he wrote on the day before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.07,0:35:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 但是他是那一天收到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes but he would have received it upon that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.05,0:35:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, quite probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.22,0:35:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那封信里会不会有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Might there have been anything in that letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.25,0:35:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诱引那孩子逃跑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which would have prompted the boy to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.42,0:35:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我可不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh, I hardly think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.87,0:35:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他能去的地方只有这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Anyway he would have run here if anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.42,0:36:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他去意大利找她母亲呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Or to his mother in Italy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.61,0:36:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.28,0:36:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨特尔勋爵肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lord Saltire would realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.92,0:36:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the impossibility of achieving such a goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.90,0:36:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是被那个德国人教唆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Even if abetted by this German,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.84,0:36:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可是个聪明实际的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he is an intelligent and practical child.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.32,0:36:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他睡觉时也会哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And yet he cries in his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.56,0:36:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人是自己寄的信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did his Grace post the letter himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.36,0:36:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人可没有寄信的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His Grace is not in the habit of posting letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.85,0:36:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那封信和其他信件一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The letter was laid with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.20,0:36:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放在书桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}upon the study table.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.48,0:36:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我亲自放在那儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I, myself, put them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.99,0:36:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除我以外能接触到它们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The only other person who would handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.27,0:36:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就只有瑞瓦兹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}would be Rivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.75,0:36:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他送日报到学校门房\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who delivers the Daily Post to the lodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.96,0:36:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定这封信跟它们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And you're sure this letter was among them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.03,0:36:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我能肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes. I observed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.06,0:36:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你发现什么了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And what have you observed, Mr. Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.19,0:36:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的调查有进展了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How does your investigation progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.25,0:36:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会让我失望吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Are you to disappoint me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.00,0:36:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我仍希望能带给您最大的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I hope still to render your greater happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.38,0:37:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并使我自己成为更富裕的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and myself a richer man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.37,0:37:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你发现了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And what have you discovered?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.55,0:37:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我澄清了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is mostly a matter of clarification.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.65,0:37:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信那孩子是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My belief is that the boy was.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.91,0:37:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被事先安排好的诱饵引出了学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}tempted out of the school by a prearrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.81,0:37:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我怀疑 他的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I suspect that his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.22,0:37:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能正是诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}may have been the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.08,0:37:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}德语教师发现了他的出逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The German master observed his departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.44,0:37:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出发去追\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and set off in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.56,0:37:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在荒原上费了一番周折\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We tracked the passage of his bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.44,0:37:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}追踪到了他的自行车踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}across the moors with much difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.75,0:37:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车胎印就好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is almost as if the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.67,0:37:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被人有意擦拭过一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}were deliberately sponged by someone…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.14,0:37:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.99,0:37:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人驾着马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Someone driving cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.80,0:37:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会碰巧知道荒原上的马车…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You don't happen to know if the cattle on the moor…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.17,0:37:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.81,0:37:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你没有看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I hope you have seen none.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.94,0:37:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这种高地气候下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We cannot winter cattle outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.94,0:37:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冬天我们是不驾车外出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in our upland climate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.43,0:37:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在接下来的这两周里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They will not be out of the yard for,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.90,0:37:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们是不会再外出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}oh at least another two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.97,0:38:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我还真是闭目塞听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then I've been as blind as the beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.88,0:38:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I thank you, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.92,0:38:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}旧蹄铁新掌钉 旧蹄铁新掌钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Old shoes and new nails! Old shoes and new nails!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.26,0:38:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你应该来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Holmes there's something you should see!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.89,0:38:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一头牛如此行走奔跑可不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is a remarkable cow which walks, canters, and gallops.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.58,0:38:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到这些马蹄铁了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you see those horseshoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.64,0:38:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.21,0:38:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带走霍尔德芮斯勋爵的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Whoever took Lord Holdernesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.34,0:38:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给他的马钉了不同的马蹄铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Shoed their horses with different horseshoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.54,0:38:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以避免被人发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}To escape detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.16,0:38:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢宾·黑斯是利用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Reuben Hayes took advantage of.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.27,0:38:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当地的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a piece of local history?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.28,0:38:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太糟了 华生 太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's bad Watson, bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.06,0:38:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}北边的秃鹰为我们指明了犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Those vultures of the north mark the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.71,0:39:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}德语教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}German master.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.47,0:39:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从尸体上能看出些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What's left of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.85,0:39:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.09,0:39:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.22,0:39:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.35,0:39:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hello, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}血肉模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Skin and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.78,0:39:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用显微镜才能知道是不是人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Only a microscope would tell if it's human.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.98,0:39:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定与黑斯脖子上的抓痕相吻合\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A consistent no doubt to the scratch on Hayes' neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.23,0:39:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.37,0:39:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死因呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Cause of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:39:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}勒杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Strangulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.72,0:40:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喉头被重压\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The larynx is quite crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.24,0:40:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个牧羊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That shepherd can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.59,0:40:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以帮我们将这噩耗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}our messenger to the priory school.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.12,0:40:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传到修道院公学\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with the news of this tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.93,0:40:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得靠走的了 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We must proceed on foot, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.60,0:40:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾很暖和\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.21,0:40:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那小旅馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}At that Inn,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像孩子们说的 很暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}warm as the children say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.91,0:40:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我越是远离小路\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The trail grows colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.29,0:40:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就越是寒冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}every step I take away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.64,0:40:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么知道把尸体放到哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How was I supposed to know where to put the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.37,0:40:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在都结束了 阿瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's all over now, Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.60,0:40:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢宾·黑斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Reuben Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.27,0:40:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿我们还不算太晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Let's hope we're not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.66,0:40:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邓洛普牌的外部加厚的车胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A Dunlop with a patch on the outer cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.22,0:41:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这儿发生什么了 黑斯夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What happened here Mrs. Hayes?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.42,0:41:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm satisfied that you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.36,0:41:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你并不赞同对这桩买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}have no liking for this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.89,0:41:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并在他们的威逼下进行了反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and that you acted under coercion.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.64,0:41:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人带走了那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Someone came for the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.28,0:41:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是公爵的秘书 瓦尔德先生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Duke's secretary, Mr. Wilder?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.32,0:41:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们朝哪走了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Which way did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.98,0:41:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是穿过荒原跑了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Across the moor?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.75,0:41:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沿着彻斯特菲尔德路\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's aboard the Chesterfield Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.95,0:41:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往他的小别墅跑去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}where be his cottage.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.67,0:41:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 黑斯夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excellent Mrs. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.90,0:41:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须得去警告公爵 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must alert the Duke's household, Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.72,0:41:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在是那孩子的守护天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You are now the boy's guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.57,0:42:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想公爵大人的支票簿就在桌子底下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I fancy I see your Grace's checkbook upon your desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.23,0:42:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将很高兴看到您写一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I would be glad if you would make me out a check.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.50,0:42:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金额为6000磅的支票给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for six thousand pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.47,0:42:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好您再背签下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Perhaps it would be best if you were to cross it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.68,0:42:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的代理银行是城乡银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The Capital and Counties Bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.51,0:42:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牛津街支行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oxford Street branch, are my agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.63,0:42:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I do not possess a temperament,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.28,0:42:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可没有这种闲情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes that appreciates.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.81,0:42:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来欣赏将您那所谓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the kind of acidulous pleasantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.20,0:42:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尖酸的幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that clearly amuses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.47,0:43:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 但我可看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I am sorry, but I do not see how.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.82,0:43:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹姆斯 就是瓦尔德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}James, Mr. Wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.09,0:43:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会牵涉到这件事中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}could possibly be implicated in this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.91,0:43:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且您也没有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and you average not proof of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.55,0:43:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But I possess the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.86,0:43:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是毋庸置疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It is beyond debate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.11,0:43:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你窗扉上的马蹄铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The mud is scarcely dry on the.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.85,0:43:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}泥引还没全干呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}cloven horseshoes in your casements.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.44,0:43:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不相信我的话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why do you doubt my word?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.65,0:43:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你似乎对一切都闭目塞听\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You seem to suffer from a blindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.72,0:43:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这种做法会带你走向疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your own interest, which borders on madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.55,0:43:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.22,0:43:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大厅里的画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}those portraits in the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.81,0:43:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是年轻时的你和你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of you and your father as young men,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.15,0:43:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的家庭秘密已经无法掩盖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}there your family liniments are very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.81,0:43:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瓦尔德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How long has Mr. Wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.26,0:43:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为你效力已经多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}been in your service?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.63,0:43:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What is your meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.14,0:43:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么敢 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How dare you sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.06,0:43:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你根本不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You do not understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.31,0:43:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个无礼的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You are a barbarian!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.99,0:43:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你永远不会… 请立刻离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You will never… please leave me immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.22,0:43:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会… 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I won't… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.29,0:44:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如我所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then it is as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.17,0:44:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹姆斯·瓦尔德先生是你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. James Wilder is your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.65,0:44:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我还年轻的时候 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When I was a very young man, Mr. Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.11,0:44:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也曾爱过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I loved,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.05,0:44:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱之深\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with such a love.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.76,0:44:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一生唯有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that comes only once in a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.73,0:44:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想跟她结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I offered the lady marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.01,0:44:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but she refused it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.37,0:44:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那样的结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on the grounds that such a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.60,0:44:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能会毁了我的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}might mar my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.67,0:44:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Had she lived,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.40,0:44:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝对不会跟别人结婚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I would certainly never had married anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.16,0:45:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.80,0:45:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只留下一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and left with one child,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.87,0:45:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是詹姆斯 因为对她的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}James, whom for her sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.81,0:45:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我抚养和培育这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have tended and cared for.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.55,0:45:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能向世人承认我们的父子关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I could not acknowledge paternity to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.09,0:45:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但除此之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but in all other ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.08,0:45:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直以亲生儿子待他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have treated him like my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.36,0:45:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要求过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He has required,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.03,0:45:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他不断辜负了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but not warranted,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.51,0:45:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对他的原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a father's forgiveness many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.66,0:45:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对此我也原谅他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I have forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.37,0:45:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原谅他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.70,0:45:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一再原谅他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have forgiven much.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.45,0:45:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人 对瓦尔德先生来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe your Grace you have done all you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.28,0:45:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for Mr. Wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.20,0:45:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须意识到你已经失去他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You must realize that he is lost to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.90,0:46:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他蓄谋绑架萨特尔勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's conspired to abduct Lord Saltire.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.71,0:46:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是一起谋杀案的帮凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's an accessory to a murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.06,0:46:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管他是否知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}however unwittingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.33,0:46:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他犯下一桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He must be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.99,0:46:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更严重的案子前 我们必须找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}before he's attempted to a crime even more terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.69,0:46:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你失去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He must be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.09,0:46:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你倾力照顾的儿子之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}before you loose the son.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.34,0:46:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that is left to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.04,0:46:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞瓦兹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Rivers?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.13,0:46:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你负责搜查荒原\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You are to organize a search of the moor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.32,0:46:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沿着西边的森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}West Woods in a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.37,0:46:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从寺庙到凉亭一路搜查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from the temple to the pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.08,0:46:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要让你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You are to employ the entire staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.00,0:46:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}without exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.89,0:46:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要找的是我的儿子 萨特尔勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You are looking for my son, Lord Saltire.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.78,0:46:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你找到了瓦尔德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If you find Mr. Wilder,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.07,0:47:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请务必扣留他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}please see that he is detained.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.94,0:47:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并将他带给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and brought to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.52,0:47:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瓦尔德截下了你的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Wilder intercepted your letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.41,0:47:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并在里面塞了一张纸条\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and substituted a note,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.97,0:47:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由此诱导你儿子相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which deceived your son into believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.98,0:47:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要见到他母亲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that he was to see his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.36,0:47:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凶狠的黑斯就是他的雇佣帮凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The murderous Hayes was his paid accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.83,0:47:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但警察都已被告知\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but the police have been alerted.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.36,0:47:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑斯跑不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hayes will not escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.75,0:47:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.99,0:47:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把他们引到荒原上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I tracked them over to the moor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.45,0:47:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可他们不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but they disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.08,0:47:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把附近都搜过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I searched the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.17,0:47:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他们就像用了遁地术凭空消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but it's as if the earth just swallowed them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.93,0:47:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据我对你家世的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}With my research into your family history.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.70,0:47:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我似乎听到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've seemed to recall mention.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.24,0:47:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一个巨大的石灰石洞穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of a huge limestone cavern.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.10,0:47:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里关着偷来的牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}where the stolen cattle were penned.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.54,0:47:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去大教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.70,0:47:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.92,0:48:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.15,0:49:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他交过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hand him over?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.37,0:49:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.52,0:49:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You shall not have him!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.69,0:49:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.98,0:49:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.17,0:49:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.53,0:50:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.91,0:50:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}James!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.90,0:50:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打算好好去爱弗朗西丝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was disposed to love Francesca.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.72,0:50:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不再是少年的激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and not with a boy's passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.12,0:50:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是男人的真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but with a man's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.53,0:50:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我与她的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My marriage to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.44,0:50:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被詹姆斯所嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}founded on James' jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.90,0:50:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我还能在他身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}As long as I could see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.92,0:50:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到他母亲的容貌和风度\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}his mother's face and manner in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.19,0:51:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹姆斯就知道他能阻挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}James knew he could keep me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.35,0:51:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本该给我妻子的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from the love I owed my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.42,0:51:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算他对阿瑟很残暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Even his cruelty to Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.16,0:51:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是无法就这样放弃他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I could not send him away even for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.66,0:51:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我就把阿瑟送走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So I sent Arthur away instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.72,0:51:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通过绑架他的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What did he hope to achieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.46,0:51:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想达到什么目的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by kidnapping his brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.93,0:51:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Money?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.79,0:51:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是身份？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Legitimacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.16,0:51:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And power.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.59,0:51:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我之上的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Power over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.83,0:51:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他喜欢对我发号施令\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He delighted in exercising power over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.15,0:51:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我们都否定他的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for me and you were to have denied him power.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.23,0:51:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否怀疑他就是绑架事件的幕后黑手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But you suspected that he was behind the abduction?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.75,0:51:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 那是我最黑暗的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In my darkest moments, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.38,0:52:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我仍希望能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yet somehow I hoped to.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.73,0:52:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.74,0:52:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这看起来就像是漫长的忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well, a long penance it had seemed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.24,0:52:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只能希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I can only hope that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.71,0:52:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯卡能原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Francesca will forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.40,0:52:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you, Mr. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.82,0:52:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.14,0:52:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是巨额酬金\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is a king's ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.80,0:52:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你又为我带回了未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You have given me back my future.
